Back Market operates a curated marketplace connecting consumers with 400+ vetted third-party refurbishers, accepting only ~33% of applicant sellers. Each seller undergoes quality audits, customer satisfaction scoring, return/refund ratio tracking, and mystery order inspections through Back Market's Innovation Lab. Sellers must maintain thresholds on complaint rates, delivery times, and review ratings. This distributed model scales certified refurbishment by aggregating diverse refurbishers—factories, repair shops, recyclers, wholesalers—under single quality governance.